      "description": "有必要边界的真实输入容器；聊天参数分组不复用卡片包装。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><label class=\"ds-composer-label\" for=\"ds-request\">创作要求</label><textarea id=\"ds-request\" placeholder=\"想把这张照片变成什么样？\"></textarea></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--composer-border,#d4d6cc);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#242622);}.ds-composer:focus-within{border-color:var(--composer-focus-border,#9ea99a);}.ds-composer-label{font-family:var(--font-sans,sans-serif);font-size:13px;}.ds-composer textarea{display:block;min-height:84px;width:100%;padding:8px 10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font-family:var(--font-sans,sans-serif);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;resize:none;}.ds-composer textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#3658c9);outline-offset:4px;outline-offset:1px;}"
    },
